# Claude Code local state — settings, skills, and git worktrees. The
# worktrees are full checkouts of this repo, so leaving them untracked but
# un-ignored meant `oxlint` walked them and reported every warning twice,
# once for the real file and once for its copy under .claude/worktrees/.
.claude/
